-- Unifind — seed data: university_resources.
--
-- Ported from Nevora's src/data/universityInternationalResources.js —
-- see 0012's header and TRANSFER_NOTES.md for what was and wasn't kept.
--
-- Coverage: Nevora only researched this level of detail (7 categories:
-- international office, housing, visa support, buddy programme, student
-- services, Erasmus, arrival info) for 7 of the 35 universities — its
-- own "Задача 19" scope, not yet extended to the rest. Honest partial
-- coverage, same discipline as everywhere else in this transfer: only
-- port real, sourced rows, leave everything else for a future pass
-- rather than inventing placeholder rows for the other 28 universities.

